<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>AgriConnect | Bongabong MAO</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"></head>
<body>
<div id="authScreen" class="auth-screen"><div class="auth-art"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">✳</span><span>AgriConnect</span></div><div class="auth-copy"><span class="eyebrow">BONGABONG MUNICIPAL AGRICULTURE OFFICE</span><h1>Growing a stronger,<br><em>more connected</em><br>agriculture sector.</h1><p>A unified workspace for agricultural records, field monitoring, and better decisions for every barangay.</p></div><div class="auth-foot">AGRICULTURE • DATA • COMMUNITY</div></div><div class="auth-panel"><form id="loginForm" class="login-card"><div class="mini-brand"><span class="brand-mark">✳</span> AgriConnect</div><span class="eyebrow green">WELCOME BACK</span><h2>Sign in to your workspace</h2><p class="muted">Use your MAO staff account to continue.</p><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@bongabong.gov.ph" required></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" placeholder="Enter your password" required></label><button class="btn primary full" type="submit">Sign in <span>→</span></button><div id="loginError" class="form-error"></div><p class="auth-note">Initial setup: create your first staff account via <code>/api/auth/register</code> or the registration API.</p></form></div></div>
<div id="appShell" class="shell hidden">
<aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand side-brand"><span class="brand-mark">✳</span><span>AgriConnect<small>Municipal Agriculture Office</small></span></div><div class="nav-caption">WORKSPACE</div><nav id="nav"><button class="nav-item active" data-page="dashboard"><span class="nav-icon">▦</span>Overview</button><div class="nav-caption">AGRICULTURE MANAGEMENT</div><button class="nav-item" data-page="farmers"><span class="nav-icon">♧</span>Farmer & Farm Registry</button><button class="nav-item" data-page="production"><span class="nav-icon">♣</span>Production & Monitoring</button><button class="nav-item" data-page="inventory"><span class="nav-icon">▤</span>Inventory & Supply</button><button class="nav-item" data-page="assistance"><span class="nav-icon">♡</span>Assistance & Subsidy</button><button class="nav-item" data-page="equipment"><span class="nav-icon">⚙</span>Equipment & Assets</button><button class="nav-item" data-page="budget"><span class="nav-icon">₱</span>Budget & Procurement</button><div class="nav-caption">FIELD RECORDS</div><button class="nav-item" data-page="livestock"><span class="nav-icon">♙</span>Livestock</button><button class="nav-item" data-page="fisheries"><span class="nav-icon">♧</span>Fisheries</button><button class="nav-item" data-page="incidents"><span class="nav-icon">⚑</span>Pest & Disease Reports</button></nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="side-user"><div class="avatar">MA</div><div><b id="sideName">MAO Staff</b><small id="sideRole">Agricultural Officer</small></div><button id="logoutBtn" title="Sign out">↗</button></div></div></aside>
<main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div><div class="breadcrumb">Bongabong MAO <span>/</span> <b id="crumb">Overview</b></div><h1 id="pageTitle">Agriculture overview</h1></div><div class="top-actions"><div class="date-chip">◷ <span id="today"></span></div><button class="icon-btn" title="Notifications">♧<i></i></button><div class="top-avatar" id="topAvatar">MA</div></div></header>
<section id="dashboardPage" class="page"><div class="welcome-row"><div><span class="eyebrow green">MONITOR • MANAGE • GROW</span><h2>Good day, <span id="welcomeName">Agriculture Team</span> <span class="wave">✳</span></h2><p class="muted">Here’s what’s happening across Bongabong’s agricultural sector.</p></div><button class="btn primary" data-goto="production">＋ Add production record</button></div>
<div class="stats-grid"><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Registered farmers</span><span class="stat-icon mint">♧</span></div><strong id="statFarmers">—</strong><small><span class="dot green-dot"></span> Farmer registry</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Production records</span><span class="stat-icon gold">♣</span></div><strong id="statProduction">—</strong><small>All crop activities</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Harvest records</span><span class="stat-icon blue">▥</span></div><strong id="statHarvests">—</strong><small>Recorded harvest events</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Open field incidents</span><span class="stat-icon rose">⚑</span></div><strong id="statIncidents">—</strong><small>Reported / under inspection</small></article></div>
<div class="content-grid"><article class="panel production-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Production monitoring</h3><p class="muted">Latest crop activity records</p></div><button class="text-btn" data-goto="production">View all ↗</button></div><div class="chart-legend"><span><i class="legend-dot emerald"></i> Planting</span><span><i class="legend-dot gold-bg"></i> Harvesting</span><span class="chart-period">LIVE RECORDS</span></div><div id="productionChart" class="bar-chart"><div class="empty-chart">Production data will appear here once records are added.</div></div><div class="chart-foot"><span>Activity volume is based on recorded production events.</span></div></article>
<article class="panel quick-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Quick actions</h3><p class="muted">Common MAO tasks</p></div></div><button class="quick-action" data-goto="farmers"><span class="quick-icon qi-green">♧</span><span><b>Register a farmer</b><small>Add farmer and farm details</small></span><i>→</i></button><button class="quick-action" data-goto="production"><span class="quick-icon qi-gold">♣</span><span><b>Record production</b><small>Planting, harvest, monitoring</small></span><i>→</i></button><button class="quick-action" data-goto="incidents"><span class="quick-icon qi-rose">⚑</span><span><b>Report field incident</b><small>Log pest, disease, or weather</small></span><i>→</i></button><button class="quick-action" data-goto="assistance"><span class="quick-icon qi-blue">♡</span><span><b>Review assistance</b><small>Track farmer applications</small></span><i>→</i></button></article></div>
<div class="content-grid lower-grid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Field activity snapshot</h3><p class="muted">Additional sector records</p></div></div><div class="snapshot-grid"><div><span class="snapshot-icon">♙</span><div><b id="statLivestock">—</b><small>Livestock head count</small></div></div><div><span class="snapshot-icon">♧</span><div><b id="statFisheries">—</b><small>Fishery volume (kg)</small></div></div><div><span class="snapshot-icon">▤</span><div><b id="statInventory">—</b><small>Inventory line items</small></div></div><div><span class="snapshot-icon">♡</span><div><b id="statPending">—</b><small>Pending assistance</small></div></div></div></article><article class="panel note-panel"><span class="eyebrow green">DATA FOR BETTER DECISIONS</span><h3>One municipality.<br>One connected view.</h3><p class="muted">Keep farm, production, and field incident records current to support timely interventions and evidence-based planning.</p><button class="text-btn" data-goto="incidents">Review field reports →</button></article></div></section>
<section id="recordsPage" class="page hidden"><div class="record-toolbar"><div><span class="eyebrow green" id="moduleEyebrow">AGRICULTURE MANAGEMENT</span><h2 id="moduleTitle">Production & Monitoring</h2><p class="muted" id="moduleDescription">Manage agricultural records.</p></div><button class="btn primary" id="addRecord">＋ Add new record</button></div><div class="panel table-panel"><div class="table-tools"><div class="search-box">⌕ <input id="tableSearch" placeholder="Search records..."></div><span class="record-count" id="recordCount">0 records</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead id="tableHead"></thead><tbody id="tableBody"></tbody></table></div><div class="table-empty hidden" id="tableEmpty">No records yet. Add your first record to get started.</div></div></section>
<footer>AgriConnect <span>•</span> Bongabong Municipal Agriculture Office <span class="footer-right">Agricultural Operations Management System</span></footer></main></div>
<div id="recordModal" class="modal hidden"><div class="modal-backdrop" data-close></div><div class="modal-card"><div class="modal-head"><div><span class="eyebrow green">RECORD MANAGEMENT</span><h3 id="modalTitle">Add record</h3></div><button class="close-btn" data-close>×</button></div><form id="recordForm"><div id="formFields" class="form-grid"></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="btn ghost" data-close>Cancel</button><button type="submit" class="btn primary">Save record <span>→</span></button></div><div id="formError" class="form-error"></div></form></div></div>
<script src="/app.js"></script></body></html>
